kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238990/extras/fd2474ad9f81b27f16ac26f11affef7b.mp4?t=1779313950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238990/extras/dc9c76d5ce7710a7345241756d69e2a3.webp?t=1779313950\" width=780 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neon-lit cityscapes and corporate strongholds to desolate slums and captivating countrysides, every environment is rich with stories, secrets, and opportunities waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238990/extras/e311f2612573827ca8b36121d728d779.poster.avif?t=1779313950\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238990/extras/e311f2612573827ca8b36121d728d779.webm?t=1779313950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238990/extras/e311f2612573827ca8b36121d728d779.mp4?t=1779313950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through sprawling urban centers, unravel hidden conspiracies, and take on missions that lead you into the depths of a world shaped by power and corruption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238990/extras/2b5aaa28812c401d4f7b5b36023b5e8e.webp?t=1779313950\" width=616 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-25 hours of story-driven gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >